# Anchored to this directory only - runtime files written by the local
# storage provider (shared/storage/providers/localProvider.js). An
# unanchored "uploads/" here also matched src/features/uploads/ (real
# source code: uploads.routes.js/controller.js/middleware.js), silently
# excluding it from every commit ever since - the exact cause of the
# production "Cannot find module './features/uploads/uploads.routes'"
# crash, since those files were never actually pushed to GitHub.
/uploads/
coverage/
